{"strongs": "H5945", "word": "עֶלְיוֺן", "translit": "el.yon", "root": "עלג", "morph": "H:A", "pos": "1.", "gloss": "high", "definition": "I. עֶלְיוֺן 22 adjective 1. high ; — masculine singular ׳ ע Deut 26:19 ; Deut 28:1 ; 1Kgs 9:8 (? reading ׳ הַבַּיִת הַזֶּה הָע as ᵐ5 L Benz ) = 2Chr 7:21 , of ׳ י Ps 97:9 . 2. upper Bethhoron, ׳ ע Josh 16:5 העליון 1Chr 7:24 ; 2Chr 8:5 , the upper (opposed to lower), of house Neh 3:25 compare 2Kgs 15:35 ; 2Chr 23:20 + 5 t., + Gen 40:17 ( uppermost basket); feminine singular הָעֶלְיוֺנָה the upper pool 2Kgs 18:17 = Isa 36:2 ; Isa 7:3 the highest side-chamber ( צֵלָע ) Ezek 41:7 feminine plural הָעֶלְיוֺנֹת Ezek 42:5 the upper chambers ( לְשָׁכוֺת ). 3. of Davidic king exalted above monarchs Ps 89:28 (compare Deut 28:1 , above).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6076')\">BDB6076</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H5945')\">H5945</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6075')\">BDB6075</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6077')\">BDB6077</entry></div><p> I. <bdbheb>עֶלְיוֺן</bdbheb><sub>22</sub> adjective <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlightword>high</highlightword>; — masculine singular <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ע</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 26:19\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(5,26,19)\">Deut 26:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 28:1\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(5,28,1)\">Deut 28:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 9:8\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(11,9,8)\">1Kgs 9:8</ref> (? reading <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>הַבַּיִת הַזֶּה הָע</bdbheb> as <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb><reflink><sup>L</sup></reflink></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Benz')\">Benz</lookup>) = <ref ref=\"2Chr 7:21\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(14,7,21)\">2Chr 7:21</ref>, of <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 97:9\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"97\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"97\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(19,97,9)\">Ps 97:9</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>upper</highlight> Bethhoron, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ע</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Josh 16:5\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(6,16,5)\">Josh 16:5</ref> <bdbheb>העליון</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Chr 7:24\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(13,7,24)\">1Chr 7:24</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 8:5\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(14,8,5)\">2Chr 8:5</ref>, <highlight>the upper</highlight> (opposed to lower), of house <ref ref=\"Neh 3:25\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(16,3,25)\">Neh 3:25</ref> compare <ref ref=\"2Kgs 15:35\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"35\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"35\" onclick=\"bcv(12,15,35)\">2Kgs 15:35</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 23:20\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(14,23,20)\">2Chr 23:20</ref> + 5 t., + <ref ref=\"Gen 40:17\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(1,40,17)\">Gen 40:17</ref> (<highlight>uppermost</highlight> basket); feminine singular <bdbheb>הָעֶלְיוֺנָה</bdbheb> <highlight>the upper</highlight> pool <ref ref=\"2Kgs 18:17\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(12,18,17)\">2Kgs 18:17</ref> = <ref ref=\"Isa 36:2\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(23,36,2)\">Isa 36:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 7:3\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(23,7,3)\">Isa 7:3</ref> <highlight>the highest</highlight> side-chamber (<bdbheb>צֵלָע</bdbheb>) <ref ref=\"Ezek 41:7\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(26,41,7)\">Ezek 41:7</ref> feminine plural <bdbheb>הָעֶלְיוֺנֹת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 42:5\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"42\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"42\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(26,42,5)\">Ezek 42:5</ref> <highlight>the upper</highlight> chambers (<bdbheb>לְשָׁכוֺת</bdbheb>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> of Davidic king exalted above monarchs <ref ref=\"Ps 89:28\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"89\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"89\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(19,89,28)\">Ps 89:28</ref> (compare <ref ref=\"Deut 28:1\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(5,28,1)\">Deut 28:1</ref>, above). </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Deut 26:19", "book": "DEU", "chapter": 26, "verse": 19}, {"raw": "Deut 28:1", "book": "DEU", "chapter": 28, "verse": 1}, {"raw": "1Kgs 9:8", "book": "1KI", "chapter": 9, "verse": 8}, {"raw": "2Chr 7:21", "book": "2CH", "chapter": 7, "verse": 21}, {"raw": "Ps 97:9", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 97, "verse": 9}, {"raw": "Josh 16:5", "book": "JOS", "chapter": 16, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "1Chr 7:24", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 7, "verse": 24}, {"raw": "2Chr 8:5", "book": "2CH", "chapter": 8, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "Neh 3:25", "book": "NEH", "chapter": 3, "verse": 25}, {"raw": "2Kgs 15:35", "book": "2KI", "chapter": 15, "verse": 35}, {"raw": "2Chr 23:20", "book": "2CH", "chapter": 23, "verse": 20}, {"raw": "Gen 40:17", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 40, "verse": 17}, {"raw": "2Kgs 18:17", "book": "2KI", "chapter": 18, "verse": 17}, {"raw": "Isa 36:2", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 36, "verse": 2}, {"raw": "Isa 7:3", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 7, "verse": 3}, {"raw": "Ezek 41:7", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 41, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "Ezek 42:5", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 42, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "Ps 89:28", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 89, "verse": 28}], "flagged": {"hebrew": ["עֶלְיוֺן", "׳", "ע", "הַבַּיִת הַזֶּה הָע", "ᵐ5", "י", "העליון", "הָעֶלְיוֺנָה", "צֵלָע", "הָעֶלְיוֺנֹת", "לְשָׁכוֺת"], "aramaic": [], "greek": [], "translit": [], "abbreviations": ["Benz", "Sept"]}, "covers": [], "bdbid": "BDB6076", "source": "BDB", "testament": "OT"}